        "detailed_description": "<h1>⭐ Features ⭐</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎴 300+ Collectible Buildings or Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 120+ Researchable BPs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📅 200+ Mainline and Random Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙 100+ Different Wizard Classes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ 200+ Random Apprentice Traits</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/0a16cba612990a3f7a9bc7a3bae20601.avif?t=1773996333\" width=780 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcana Academy is a magic-themed card simulation management game filled with many mysteries waiting to be discovered. In the game, you play as a mage headmaster, freely constructing your magic academy, summoning human, elf, and even dangerous vampire and werewolf students to support the reconstruction of the empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/eec7e7835365adbecf6a7f2e08e5812c.avif?t=1773996333\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you could freely Construct and develop your Magic Academy, would you choose to teach Students or nurture Monsters?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use over 300 collectible buildings or cards to freely construct your own magic academy, from Regular Classrooms to Mage Spires, from manual Workshops to automated Production—upgrade Facilities and Buildings step by step, improve Production lines, and boost Production efficiency. Summon different Races, handle sudden Events, and explore over 200 unique Mainline or random Events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/ff70de9e9cfef80fd84a5c851ee4c7a2.poster.avif?t=1773996333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/ff70de9e9cfef80fd84a5c851ee4c7a2.webm?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/ff70de9e9cfef80fd84a5c851ee4c7a2.mp4?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/2da78954592fb5d7245f2918b786bc1f.avif?t=1773996333\" width=616 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What happens when the mysterious Summon Student ritual circle is tainted with Demon blood? Where will the Ritual lead?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 40 mysterious and special summon rituals, add your favorite materials to the ritual—offerings can be souls, money, or even living beings. The correct execution of a ritual usually requires fixed offerings, and the results are generally consistent; but if you break the rules, the outcome may lead to terrifying unknowns...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/c531a47f9d1117dad2cec43ba3a3fa8d.poster.avif?t=1773996333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/c531a47f9d1117dad2cec43ba3a3fa8d.webm?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/c531a47f9d1117dad2cec43ba3a3fa8d.mp4?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/82214220a3294bc2185b6040ae2f1d52.avif?t=1773996333\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize every aspect of your academy, from its name to its teaching philosophy—will you pursue all-around development or focus on specialization?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every academy's name and emblem can be freely defined. analyze each apprentice's unique trait combination (randomly generated from over 200 traits), select and admit them to your academy, teach according to their abilities, and enforce discipline with over 40 different academy rules for those lacking self-control. With over 100 different magic books, help them unravel the mysteries of the elements, Select their future class paths, and complete assessments. There are over 100 different wizard class selection assessments, leading them to become geniuses... or fall into mediocrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/4aa9216b91a944d4f89ef8c2b397edc7.poster.avif?t=1773996333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/4aa9216b91a944d4f89ef8c2b397edc7.webm?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/4aa9216b91a944d4f89ef8c2b397edc7.mp4?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/94104c7ac80b596195fbf72dac9b4bfa.avif?t=1773996333\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When facing fearsome monsters and demons, will you select to fight together, or offer some &quot;offerings&quot; to temporarily ease the crisis?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your academy's construction, monsters will constantly eye you with hostility. To ensure peace and stability for your academy, you can send people to deal with them, or pay some &quot;protection fees&quot; in exchange for more development opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/bd997c663b11d9ed87f6e206ac242b5e.poster.avif?t=1773996333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/bd997c663b11d9ed87f6e206ac242b5e.webm?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/bd997c663b11d9ed87f6e206ac242b5e.mp4?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/d2979107877b46531998bf219b1e8105.avif?t=1773996333\" width=616 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will the ever-unlocking new magic and technology help you create a Legend, or bring more disasters and crises?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 120 researchable blueprints, as you expand your academy, you will encounter new knowledge and magic, master more technology, and fully automate production to rapidly develop your academy. But continuous development is a double-edged sword—more crises may follow, so be sure to prepare accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/dfa3c5d9a1abe5c9fa6123188e8b705c.poster.avif?t=1773996333\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/dfa3c5d9a1abe5c9fa6123188e8b705c.webm?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612250/extras/dfa3c5d9a1abe5c9fa6123188e8b705c.mp4?t=1773996333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you enjoy any of the following titles, we think you’ll love <i>Arcana Academy</i>:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hogwarts Legacy, Harry Potter, Mind Over Magic, Stacklands, Cultist Simulator, Cardboard Town, Ways of Alchemy, Spellcaster University, Stack to Ascension, Card Cultivation, WitchHand, Witchbrook...</p>",
